172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (India faces a critical employment challenge characterized by high youth unemployment, rising educated joblessness, and a significant skill mismatch between academia and industry. Despite economic growth and technological advancement, the lack of structured and scalable hiring platforms limits access to employment opportunities, particularly for youth in Tier 2 and Tier 3 regions. There is an urgent need for a national-level intervention that directly connects talent with employers, enables mass hiring, and generates measurable employment outcomes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
